{
    "title": "Famous Blox Show: Fashion Star",
    "description": "Want to be a fashion star and have your own famous show? Always have the best outfits that look perfect for you?\r\nFamous Blox Show: Fashion Star is the perfect gift for you.\r\n\r\nFamous Blox Show: Fashion Star is a 3D blox game which you have to combine outfit, make your unique style, become a famous fashion on the runway. You can be a model, baddie, princess,... the ultimate gaming experience that combines fashion, creativity, and friendly competition in once.\r\n\r\nIn this spectacular fashion world, you can:\r\n\r\n- Make your unique style: The endless of clothing, accessories, and hairstyles to create the perfect look that represents yourself.\r\n- New you everyday: Enjoy every challenges & outfits combination and renew yourself every day.\r\n- Runway catwalk: Bring your final outfit challenge on the runway to impress the judges, aiming for the top spot in the fashion battle rankings.\r\n\r\nFamous Blox Show: Fashion Star. Don't miss out on the chance to become a fashion icon, show your fashion prowess and compete against fellow style enthusiasts.\r\nDownload for free and enjoy right now!!!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Want to be a fashion star and have your own famous show? Always have the best outfits that look perfect for you?<br>Famous Blox Show: Fashion Star is the perfect gift for you.<br><br>Famous Blox Show: Fashion Star is a 3D blox game which you have to combine outfit, make your unique style, become a famous fashion on the runway. You can be a model, baddie, princess,... the ultimate gaming experience that combines fashion, creativity, and friendly competition in once.<br><br>In this spectacular fashion world, you can:<br><br>- Make your unique style: The endless of clothing, accessories, and hairstyles to create the perfect look that represents yourself.<br>- New you everyday: Enjoy every challenges &amp; outfits combination and renew yourself every day.<br>- Runway catwalk: Bring your final outfit challenge on the runway to impress the judges, aiming for the top spot in the fashion battle rankings.<br><br>Famous Blox Show: Fashion Star. Don&#39;t miss out on the chance to become a fashion icon, show your fashion prowess and compete against fellow style enthusiasts.<br>Download for free and enjoy right now!!!",
